T*
(When you disagree with someone, there are two paths forward. The first is to try to engage with) Tj
T*
(what they?re saying: what their reasons are, whether their position is true, what evidence) Tj
T*
(could be brought to bear, and so on. The second is to diagnose them: to engage with the) Tj
T*
(second-order question of why they?re saying it. For instance, if you?re arguing with somebody) Tj
T*
(about microservices 1 , you could say ?well, you only like microservices because you want to) Tj
T*
(polish your resume?, or ?you only like monoliths because you?re scared of distributed systems?.) Tj
