(the dumber they get, the smarter AI models seem in comparison. Likewise, many pro-AI people) Tj
T*
(argue that people only disagree because they?re Luddites, or scared of change, and so on. None) Tj
T*
(of these arguments are about the quality of AI models. It feels so good to diagnose your) Tj
